<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Titusi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lihamba lya Paulo kwa Titusi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Titusi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tit</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lihamba lya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Titusi</para>
  <para style="iot">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Lihamba hai kwa Titusi ni imonga gha lihamba njechi kuhuma kwa Paulo amyandikilili mundu badili gha lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito. lihamba ghangi itatu ni lihamba lya mtumbulo kwa Timoseo na lihamba lya ivili kwa Timoseo na Filemoni. Paulo amyandikilili Titusi, ila ayandikili hilahila handa lihamba isomilwi paluagha kwa lilowi. Tungumanya havi kwaikiva Paulo angulongela vila kapalwa kuwela mndumindumi. Kindu kivile Titusi akimanyili kala. Paulo inguwesekana ayandikili lihamba hai machuva gha 63 - 65 badili gha kuwelekwa Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo ayandikili lihamba hai kumlaghila Titusi kulongosa lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito livile kukighunguli kya Kilete. Paulo ayandikili lihamba hai kumlongela Titusi ili kuhaghula na kuvula vilongosi wa lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito. Paulo ampeghili malaghilo yalayala handa lihamba amyandikilili Timoseo. lihamba ghaki inguvula vila vilongosi wa lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito wangupalwa kutundamilwa nesu. Malipinga gha wandu wamkwinila Kilisito na vilongosi wa lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito wa lipindi lya hinaa wangupalwa kuloleswa kwa upabehi nesu kulihengu lya kulongosa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha mghati:</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angumlongela Titusi kuhaghula vilongosi wala wangumtundamila Sapanga hai inguhuma ku Sula gha 1:1-16.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angumlongela Titusi kuvula wandu ili kulama handa Sapanga angupala hai inguhuma ku Sula gha 2:1-3:11.</para>
  <para style="io">Mwihu, Paulo anguyomola kwa kulongelela amonga gha mighalu ghaki na kuyegha lijambuso lyaki hai inguhuma ku Sula gha 3:12-15.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1" />lihamba hai inguhuma kwa nenga Paulo, mtumikila wa Sapanga na mndumindumi wa Yesu kilisito.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 1:1">Nenga niyeghwa kuwalongela wahaghulwa wa Sapanga yala yangulongela ukwinila na kuwavula wamanyi uchakaka hula unguwalongosa kundamilu gha kumtundamila Sapanga, <verse eid="TIT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2" />uchakaka hau uvile kitamilo kyaki ni kupokela ukomu wa machuwa yayendelela. Sapanga ailongile ng'ogha uhwangi atulaghilili ukomu hau pambila gha kulumbwa kwa mlima wogha, <verse eid="TIT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3" />na mweni kwa lipindi lyaki Sapanga akaugubutula kulilando lyaki nenga nihaghula kulilando hali nitangasi kukovekelana laghililo lya Sapanga mlokola wa twenga.<verse eid="TIT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4" />Ningukuyandikila wenga Titusi, mwana wa nenga wa chakaka kuukwinila hula tunguukovekela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 1:4">Ningukutakila manemu na kulikala maha kuhuma kwa Sapanga Tati, na kuhuma kwa kilisito Yesu, mlokola wa twenga.<verse eid="TIT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihengu lya Titusi kula kukighungu kya Kilete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5" />Nikulekili kula ku Kilete lukani ugholi maha hila mighalu yahighalile kuwoneka maha, na kuwahaghula wagogolo kukila mmbwani handa vila nikulaghilili. <verse eid="TIT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6" />Mgogolo wa lipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila Kilisito angupalwa kuwela mundu kawela ng'ogha na uhakata, avile na mdala mmonga hela, na wana ghaki wangupalwa kuwela wakwinila, wakotoho kuwoneka watatala au wahakata. <verse eid="TIT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7" />kwaikiva kilongosi wa lipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga wamkwinila Kilisito ni mgholokela wa lihengu lya Sapanga, hinu angupalwa kuvile mundu avile ng'ogha na kulalamikilwa, hilahila aweli ng'ogha na mikwinakwina, akotoho kuwela myuyughu wa lilaka, mlowela, na akotoho kuwela mundu mweni lumatamata lwa mapesa ghaki ng'ogha. <verse eid="TIT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8" />Angupalwa kuvile mundu yaapala wahenja na angupala mighalu maha. angupalwa kuvile mundu mweni kujilongosa mweni, angughola ng'ogha uhakata, mundu yapala kughola maheli na kughola yala yangupalwa na mundu kahaghulwa kwaikiva gha Sapanga na mweni ndyangilu maha. <verse eid="TIT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9" />Ingumpala akoli maha lila lilando lya ukwinila handa linguvulwa. Lukasini awesi kuwataya moyu waghangi kwa mavulo gha uchakaka na kuwesa kuyavika lipala mahakata gha wala wandu wanguyangingama mavulo hagha.<verse eid="TIT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10" />Kwaikiva kuvile na wandu watangala nesunesu wahumili kudini gha Wayahudi, wavile ni watatala wangulonga milando yavile na maha ng'ogha na kuwabyodosa waghaghi. <verse eid="TIT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11" />Ingupalwa kuwakanisa wandu hagha kwaikiva wangubyodosa mighuta itangala kwa mavulo ghao gha uhwangi, wangughola nagha lukani waipatili mapesa. <verse eid="TIT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12" />Hata mmonga wa walota ghao, avile ni Mkilete, ailongile, “Wakilete wangulonga uhwangi machuwa hyogha, ni handa mikokolu mihakata, wapweli na wadomela matongi !” <verse eid="TIT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13" />Milando hai ailongile ni uchakaka na kwaikiva gha nagha, ungupalwa kuwakalipila kwa kukalipa, ili wawesi kugangamala kuukwinila ghao, <verse eid="TIT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14" />Wakotoho kukovekela mahumu gha Wayahudi au malaghililo gha wala wandu waukanila kala uchakaka. <verse eid="TIT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15" />Kila kindu kijumilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga kwa wala wandu wajumilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga. Ila kwahela chochosi kijumilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga kwa wandu wala wanguliwachila uhakata kwaikiva mawachilo gha weni yamema uhakata. <verse eid="TIT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16" />Wandu handa hagha wangulidumbila yiwa wangummanya Sapanga, ila kwa matendu gha weni wangumkanila Sapanga. Hagha ni wandu wahakata na wayitikila ng'ogha na wamaha ng'ogha kwa mghalu wowosi maha.<verse eid="TIT 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2" />
  <para style="s">Mavulo gha uchakaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1" />Ila wenga ungupalwa kuvula mavulo gha uchakaka. <verse eid="TIT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2" />Uwalongeli wagogolo yiwa wangupalwa kuvile wandu wa maha, na wavile wandu wa kutundamilwa na kujilongosa weni, wangupalwa kukwinila mavulo gha uchakaka, na upalo na ufumilifu. <verse eid="TIT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3" />Hilahila muwalongeli wadala wagogolo walikali vila mhaghulwa kwaikiva gha Sapanga wangupalwa walikali, wakotoho kuwela wandu wa kusongesela au walowela ila wangupalwa kuvula mighalu gha maha, <verse eid="TIT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4" />lukani wawagholi wadala waposilwi ila wagogolo ng'ogha kuwapala wangwana ghao na wana ghao, <verse eid="TIT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5" />wavile na kujilongosa weni na waweli weni kujumilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga, wawesi kutimilisa kwa umaheli mighalu gha ukaya kwa weni, na waweli walungwana na wawatundamili wangwana ghao, lukani ujumbi wa Sapanga ukotoho pughanywa.<verse eid="TIT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6" />Hilahila uwatayi moyu wahongolo wavile na kujilongosa weni. <verse eid="TIT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7" />Wenga ungupalwa kuvile mlandano kumatendu hyogha maha. Ukilangiha uchakaka na ukotoho kuyumbila kumavulo ghako. <verse eid="TIT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8" />Tumila milando ghamaha yala yasiyoweza kukosolewa lukani wahakata ghako wapughanyiki pawalola ng'ogha chochosi kihakata kya kutulongelela twenga.<verse eid="TIT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9" />Uwavuli wahusutu kuwatundamila wakulu ghao kukila mghalu na wayangalayi kuwahekelesa. Wakotoho kusindana na weni, <verse eid="TIT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10" />hata kuwahijila hindu ghao. Ila wawonesi yiwa weni ni wandu wa maha machuwa yayendelela, lukani kwa matendu ghao wayagholi mavulo gha Sapanga Mlokola wa twenga kuwakwegha waghangi.<verse eid="TIT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11" />Kwaikiva Sapanga kagubutula ulungwana ghaki hau unguwalokola wandu wogha. <verse eid="TIT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12" />Ulungwana hau ungutuvula kuleka ndyangilu imhekelesa ng'ogha Sapanga na lumatamata lwa mlima wogha ili tutami ngalilu gha kujilongosa weni gha kumtundamila Sapanga kumlimawogha hau wa hinaa, <verse eid="TIT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13" />Tukiva tungulindila litumaini lila lya highili na kuhighiliswa kwa ukwilikihi wa Sapanga wa twenga mkulu na avile mlokola wa twenga Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="TIT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14" />Mweni alihumisili mweni baha kwaikiva gha twenga ili atulokoli kuhuma kuuhakata wogha na kutughola tuweli wandu maheli wa mweni baha, wandu wavile na luhujulu lwa kughola mighalu maha. <verse eid="TIT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15" />Hinu wenga uwavuli mighalu hayi, watayi moyu na wakalipile kwa uweso ghako wogha. Mundu yoyosi na akotoho kukupughanya.<verse eid="TIT 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3" />
  <para style="s">Vila wangupalwa kulikala wala wamkwinila Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1" />Uwakumbusi wandu kuwanyenyekela vilongosi na wala wavile na ukulu, kuwayoghanila na kuliyandala kwa kughola mighalu hyogha maha. <verse eid="TIT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2" />Walongeli wakotoho kumligha mundu yoyosi, ila walikali wakotoho kutovana, na waweli wanyalinyali na wanyenyekela machuwa hyogha kwa wandu wogha. <verse eid="TIT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3" />Kwaikiva lipindi limonga na twenga tuwelili wasihisihi, watatala na wabyodoka. Tuwelili wahusutu wa lumatamata na luheku lumhekelesa ng'ogha Sapanga. Tulikalili na uhakata na wifu, wandu watuhyomelilili na twenga baha tukahyomelana. <verse eid="TIT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4" />Ila lipindi lya ulungwana na upalo wa Sapanga, mlokola wa twenga paugubutulwa, <verse eid="TIT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5" />atulokolili ng'ogha kwaikiva gha mghalu maha tuughola twenga, ila kwaikiva gha luhungu lwaki. Atulokolili kwa kutuhumisila mahakata gha twenga ingumanisa kulelwa hyonu kwa njila gha Mpumulo wa Sapanga, <verse eid="TIT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6" />Sapanga kamlaghila Yesu Kilisito mlokola wa twenga kutupegha Mpumulo ghaki kwa utangala, <verse eid="TIT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7" />ili kwa ulungwana ghaki tupati kujumilwa kuulongolo gha Sapanga na kuwela walihi wa ukomu wa machuwa yayendelela handa tungulitumaini. <verse eid="TIT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8" />Mghalu hau ni chakaka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:8">Ningupala uwavuli kwa mkasu, ili wala wamkwinila Sapanga wawesi kuvile na luhujulu lwa kughola maha machuwa hyogha mighalu hai ni maheli na kangi yavile na hupo kwa wandu wogha. <verse eid="TIT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9" />Ila uhyeti utatala wa kisiisii, kulongelana mahina gha ukolu na makologhanyo na masindano yala yalongelela laghilo, kwaikiva mighalu hai ivile ng'ogha na hupo na gha yaghiyaghi. <verse eid="TIT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10" />Mundu yula angughola mikologhanyo umkanisi akotoho kughola lihanja lya mtumbulo na lihanja lya ivili na kuulongolo umleki. <verse eid="TIT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11" />Umanyi yiwa mundu wa nagha kabyodoka, na sambi ghaki inguhighilisa yiwa kabyodoka.<verse eid="TIT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghilo gha mwihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12" />Nipala kumlaghila Alitema au Tukiko kwa wenga. Paahika pepayi uyangalahi nesu ukongine na nenga haku ku Nikopoli, kwaikiva nilamula kulikala haku lipindi lya lupepo. <verse eid="TIT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13" />Uyangalayi kuwayegha Zenasi yula mundu wa ulamulo na Apolo na uhighilisi yiwa wavile na kila kindu kingupalwa mumwanja. <verse eid="TIT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14" />Wandu wa twenga ni lasima walivuli kughola maha ili wakongine na iwatangi lipindi lya lung'ai. Wakotoho kuwela wandu wasio na fwaida.<verse eid="TIT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15" />Wandu wogha wawela pamonga na nenga wangukujambusa. Uwajambusi wala wangutupala twenga kuukwinila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:15">Ninguwatakila wogha manemu gha Sapanga.<verse eid="TIT 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3" />
</usx>